  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In Meng Zhen immortal aperture, the north-most field holds hundreds of huge desolate bones from dream path ancient desolate beast corpses. Those bones are dream path Gu materials. Meng Qiu Zhen sets a Gu formation over them and creates a bone dream sand farm. The farm is nourished with bone marrow and gradually turns the soil into dream sand.",
