        "sys_gu_formation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Dream sand is listed with earth dream fetus hair, nine tune dream flower, dream river water, and tongue tip small dream fish as dream path Gu materials Fang Yuan obtained in that period. Dream path Gu materials were still rare then; after the move into Meng Zhen aperture, away from surrounding earth path dao marks, they could grow more freely and were expected to yield a stream of immortal materials.",
